(
    title: "Tutankham",
    developer: Some("Dave Engman, Dawn Stockbridge"),
    description: Some("An archeologist loots King Tut\'s tomb chamber by chamber, and his laser only fires left or right — never up or down — so creatures springing from their nests have to be lined up rather than simply shot. A key must be in hand before the door at the end of each maze will open, and the time band drains your ammunition the longer you linger."),
